This MIT grant covers the CODE in this repository.

Assets shipped alongside the code carry their own terms, documented in the game
directory that contains them:

- `games/jacquard-index/vendor/fonts/` — Atkinson Hyperlegible, SIL Open Font
  License 1.1. Full license text: `vendor/fonts/OFL-AtkinsonHyperlegible.txt`.
- `games/innsmouth-2000/assets/music/`, `games/stray-squadron/assets/music/`,
  `games/oddseedz/assets/music/` — operator-supplied music tracks, credited to
  the pseudonym **Abel Aeolian**. Per-track notes and the terms under which they
  ship are in each folder's `README.md`. They are not covered by the MIT grant
  above.

Every other asset in every game is generated by the game's own code at build or
run time — there are no third-party sprites, tilesets, or textures in this
repository.
